{"id":1150702,"name":"에코·심문 II","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"에코·심문 II","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1150702]}],"trial":{"trial_id":150702,"stage":"2단계","unlock_time":"2024-03-12 14:00:00","diary1":"남의 말을 전혀 듣지 않는 에코의 고집 때문에, 당신은 그녀를 돕기 위해선 우회적인 방법을 써야 한다는 것을 깨달았다. 마침 음악회를 앞두고 있어, 당신은 공연 리허설의 명목으로 에코가 음치 교정을 받을 수 있도록 계획했다.","diary2":"에코의 형편없는 음감과 연주 실력은 3명의 '대중음악가'를 매우 힘들게 했지만, 힘겨운 연습 끝에 예전보다는 나아졌다. 한편, 에코의 열정에 감동받은 당신은 그녀의 가장 열렬한 관객이 되어주기로 약속했다.","evidence":[{"ID":260541,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260542,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":3,"dialogue_id":250702017,"next":[18]},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250702023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":